# Vulnerabilities that the image scans are told to accept, for the pull request scan and the scan of a
# published image (.github/workflows/images.yml). Nothing is accepted today.
#
# Every entry has a reason on the line directly above it and an expiry date on its own line, and the scan does
# not start if either is missing or the date has passed (scripts/check-trivyignore.sh):
#
#   # reason: the vulnerable function is never called by the gateway; waiting for the base image update
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Prefer fixing the finding (a newer dependency or base image). Keep the expiry short, and see
# docs/runbooks/service-deployment.md for what to do when the scan fails.
